OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,6,FRemaining largely dry with sunny
OL,7,Fspells on Monday. Showers and possibly
OL,8,Fthunderstorms developing on Tuesday,
OL,9,Fwith these becoming more widespread
OL,10,Fand heavier by Wednesday. Feeling
OL,11,Fwarmer, especially in the sunshine.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
